;------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 0A92H - Jump into another bank and back (BANKJP, RST 18H)
; Called as  RST 18H / DW target.  The bank follows from the target:
;   0000H-3FFFH -> pages 0 and 1 = bank 0      4000H-7FFFH -> page 1 = bank 3
;   8000H-BFFFH -> page 2 = bank 6             C000H-FFFFH -> page 1 = bank 0,
;                                              address - 8000H
; Port 3DH := 04H.  The return slot that pointed at the operand is replaced
; by the saved port 31H / 3DH values and BJPRET is pushed as the target's
; return address, so the target returns straight to the caller of the jump-
; table entry with the banking restored.
