; 383DH-386CH: CALL into P1-B0; port 31H is saved at FE62H and restored by
;   B0CALLRET (38F0H) when the target returns.
; 3887H-38A1H: JUMP into the hidden BASIC ROM (bank 3b: page 1 = bank 3,
;   port 3DH = 0).
; 38B3H-38DBH: CALL into bank 3b, restored through B0CALLRET.
